# UniPath environment variables.
#
# Supabase is OPTIONAL. Leave these blank and the app runs fully in anonymous
# mode (shortlist, profile, cost scenarios, and applications all persist to the
# browser's localStorage). Fill them in to enable optional accounts that sync a
# user's data across devices.
#
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the migration in supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql (SQL editor or CLI)
# 3. In Auth > URL Configuration, add <your-site-url>/auth/callback as a redirect URL
# 4. Copy the Project URL and the anon/publishable key below into .env.local
#
# Only the anon (publishable) key belongs here — never the service_role key.
# Row Level Security is the security boundary, so the anon key is safe in the browser.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
